# A DEPLOY DIRECTORY IS A PUBLIC DIRECTORY. Everything tracked under venueplay/
# and partyplay/ is uploaded to Cloudflare Pages and served to anyone who asks
# for it by name, linked or not. On 11 Sep 2026 twenty-seven internal files were
# being served that way, including a suite that printed a local path to the world.
# These scripts belong in the -backend sibling. git is the first gate that stops
# them coming back; tools/release-check.py --local is the second.
venueplay/**/*.py
venueplay/**/*.sql
venueplay/**/*.sh
venueplay/**/*.test.js
venueplay/**/*.md
venueplay/supabase/
venueplay/tools/
partyplay/**/*.py
partyplay/**/*.sql
partyplay/**/*.sh
partyplay/**/*.test.js
partyplay/**/*.md

